      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't even want to rebuild it. there's nothing left to build. if the 'me' part is already gone, then it's just a body going through the motions. it feels so much more logical to just stop pretending. if i'm not even here to witness my own life, why should i keep carrying the weight of it?",
